    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8a2eab6f2b6593735c7df83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "回程的路上，训练员为了测试\n她成长过后的实力，便建议她参加\n西野花也会参赛的“短途马S”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b43e714a9f97509c01c6f8bfe8f1ae132bb47e286112c4f5c0a972d5ee3d5bc9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff70ebaf1d8c9730aa13a611",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b9325ee8635955497e5a78c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王本来就希望\n能与西野花再次对决……\n于是她表示真的下不为例──",
      "source_fingerprint": "99b4f066727ff0a914fe76ea4904e6120816a676abdea63de5792269661dfca1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a0cf1b68762749f526c617d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a479b8ff08c340444e2de13d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她决定在“短途马S”二度出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "632feaa177f8c703d8e66a2b8ac7ffac941fa660f174b5a9baa07c67171e6f11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55001c3b7fdd9c2ed06d4e25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "人马S结束后・3600！！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a9a4ebd122cab30427ffd3a4fe5b74bb1e25b27916f3eda630ab689b3e09258",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041430.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:079c24d535d48932c2a1864a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王超越了西野花，\n漂亮地将胜利纳入手中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eed5a0f1bcf2a0ac58e3472cfb3094e9a298b87c4f60533ae6933cf0bb9064d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:397bec666667ff199c26edf5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员确定她的实力已有足够成长，\n即使是英里赛一样能跑到终点，\n于是决定让她参加“英里CS”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "118281cc9210e0040c0ec649c6c47a5707baa8660a067e334ae1a8bb79eee170",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2890eeef354633eb88760b7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王终于要跑\n比短途赛稍微长一丁点的距离……\n她即将挑战英里赛事！",
      "source_fingerprint": "712bf4945ef2f824e16b647c7f76beb5208fdd71d8da3dee5c0d839414374b00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f503cf07e137c55fc9787e87",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "短途马S结束后・迈向英里",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc541e402a82016647cb3616af5a751e6d7cc624fcc44519de7d2c1250db2af3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041431.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f228f458769aefda7719e7d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王成功压制住西野花，\n再次在“短途马S”夺冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "020f286c564dbc342d76e47659d4f6bd474f71c28526727eb38ada0bc10cef22",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bba328364162e7efa8431bc9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到她在大型赛事中连战连胜，\n训练员毫无保留地大力称赞她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "009d6815da3ecaea8ded2bdae99b53e47fe87c9cb7814b6525bda1a3a9371e48",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d040d8f7c220dfc8144b55db",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "如今她已经成长到能连续拿下“短途马S”，\n凭她的实力，挑战1600米也不是问题。\n训练员对此深信不疑──",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c2c2985b2f1f9e0592153a9fcded1e9d20dc24f0df0ca606628df7b879e35e4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f08a565f9323ac04d933f918",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是决定比短途赛多增加一丁点距离，\n让她前去参加……“英里CS”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17b5f23e1caa1c3922e2c070829cd16da810846af6944732720b08f084ab941c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab45b10b20699faabf1a4b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "短途马S结束后・连霸！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bc9bfc56ac42827205b7b9397b099cd89581cb4fa948a662bf344a77cfa1fce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041432.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4049164ecac7acc5244059a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“英里CS”这1600米对樱花进王来说，\n是极为漫长的距离，\n但她跑完了，并夺得了胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "642ab3e0db4066d6dd779196fde3b336c2e6c3f988bdaaf24828084aff4ddb64",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06930a0ab0e7d28fabf09026",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "樱花进王面对自己的优秀才华与未来发展，\n内心感到澎湃不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8d49cc3da233c214efbd0290148316f4af1ead60bacc011fda6bedaccc0d3af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1ff1cc89e5cd4bc310a3cd3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她的挑战还没结束！\n直到称霸爆进之道为止，她依然会――\n持续爆进！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1575c58278fb77eab071951bea7b02b56e1487922ed38d43724dea5b657dd9fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:256376eb297e57c7e77b0e3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "英里CS结束后・传说爆诞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "35e1dc00a506d3e796f700a39fb50245474e0c48f89dc3fc3da9d1d907fc5e39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041433.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59cb6d28416abc3fc1970350",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "早上当我来到训练员室时，\n看到桌上放着一张纸……",
      "source_fingerprint": "834d642a18e1f33f1b067fc094b5fb070c5dbf27aa14b381059f1e3b8cdcbd61",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041500.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:89211ebe938bc5d6754d0489",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“体育馆碰面！\n　　　　　　　　　　　　班长敬上！”",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee48c54618cefbf62600b315c56b94f3edb621e7cd43eadf80b7a6a9c5f81093",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041500.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50a08e17ca7c5d481dbd200f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "看到总是奇招百出的她写了温馨感人的信──\n……是奖状，让我的泪腺有点不争气了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a502fac7b93dfa6ea6ac74d03ac5f51f4c0b053e979bac27110525a1d022537",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1041/storytimeline_501041500.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:689eb225900597146e7654f1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心、心理准备！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee975b700136274a03076531088c2e815977ecd77b47c84c670a84b8c1242da9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
